os/cakephp/cakephp/milestones/7","html_url":"https://github.com/cakephp/cakephp/milestone/7","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cakephp/cakephp/milestones/7/labels","id":453043,"node_id":"MDk6TWlsZXN0b25lNDUzMDQz","number":7,"title":"3.0.0","description":"New major release that breaks compatibility with 2.x\r\n\r\n- PHP5.4.19+\r\n- New ORM & behaviors.\r\n- Improved Routing\r\n- PSR-0 and composer support.\r\n- Simpler configuration and bootstrapping.\r\n- Improved configuration handling.\r\n- Improved bake.\r\n\r\nSee [the roadmap](http://github.com/cakephp/cakephp/wiki/3.0-roadmap) for more details.","creator":null,"open_issues":0,"closed_issues":2464,"state":"closed","created_at":"2013-10-11T20:56:23Z","updated_at":"2015-12-17T03:00:48Z","due_on":"2015-03-22T04:00:00Z","closed_at":"2015-03-23T01:02:41Z"},"comments":9,"created_at":"2014-03-29T13:50:42Z","updated_at":"2014-03-30T03:55:44Z","closed_at":"2014-03-30T00:59:53Z","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"Originally in #3158.\n\nBecause it is calculated using `Query::page()` and it relies on `limit` being already calculated; and because `PaginatorComponent::getDefaults()` always returns `page` before `limit` in the array, it will be wrong most of the time.\n\nWe can change that order, but I don't think that's a fix because the public methods are still there: `Query::page()`, `Query::offset()`, `Query::limit()` and `Query::applyOptions()`.\n\nMaybe we need to make some functions protected and the ones that are exposed follow a specific order so that it is always built the same way. Maybe the default `limit=25` has to go away.\n","closed_by":{"login":"markstory","id":24086,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI0MDg2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/24086?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https:/